{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-transformation","title":"协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/protocol-transformation","wordCount":893,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协议转换与请求变换-网关如何做格式桥接\">协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>协议转换</strong></td>\n<td>在不同传输协议或消息格式之间做转换，如 REST↔gRPC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>请求变换</strong></td>\n<td>在转发前修改请求（Header、Path、Body）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>响应变换</strong></td>\n<td>修改后端返回的响应内容再转发给客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>转码（Transcoding）</strong></td>\n<td>gRPC-HTTP 转码特指 proto 定义驱动的双向翻译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>内容协商</strong></td>\n<td>根据客户端能力（Accept Header）返回不同格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么协议转换是必要的\">为什么协议转换是必要的？</h2><p>内外部系统的协议选择往往存在天然分歧：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>外部</strong>：浏览器/App 只支持 HTTP/JSON，RESTful 接口是事实标准</li>\n<li><strong>内部</strong>：微服务间使用 gRPC（强类型、高效二进制、双向流）效率更高</li>\n<li><strong>遗留系统</strong>：SOAP/XML 接口无法快速改造，需要保持向后兼容</li>\n</ul>\n<p>网关在这两个世界之间做翻译，让各方保持最适合自己的协议，互不妥协。</p>\n<h2 id=\"grpc-http-转码\">gRPC-HTTP 转码</h2><p>gRPC-HTTP 转码（Transcoding）将 HTTP/JSON 请求转换为 gRPC 调用，反向亦然。转码的映射关系由 proto 文件中的 <code>google.api.http</code> 注解定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// user_service.proto&#10;syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;service UserService {&#10;  rpc GetUser(GetUserRequest) returns (User) {&#10;    option (google.api.http) = {&#10;      get: &quot;/api/v1/users/{user_id}&quot;   // HTTP GET 映射到 gRPC GetUser&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  rpc CreateUser(CreateUserRequest) returns (User) {&#10;    option (google.api.http) = {&#10;      post: &quot;/api/v1/users&quot;&#10;      body: &quot;*&quot;                         // 请求体映射到 proto 消息&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// user_service.proto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc GetUser(GetUserRequest) returns (User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    option (google.api.http) = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      get: \"/api/v1/users/{user_id}\"   // HTTP GET 映射到 gRPC GetUser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc CreateUser(CreateUserRequest) returns (User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    option (google.api.http) = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      post: \"/api/v1/users\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      body: \"*\"                         // 请求体映射到 proto 消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了这份注解，Envoy 的 gRPC-JSON 转码器（或 grpc-gateway）能自动生成转换逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"HTTP GET /api/v1/users/123&#10;  → gRPC UserService.GetUser({user_id: &quot;123&quot;})&#10;  → gRPC 响应 User{id: &quot;123&quot;, name: &quot;...&quot;}&#10;  → HTTP 200 {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;123&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;...&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP GET /api/v1/users/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → gRPC UserService.GetUser({user_id: \"123\"})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → gRPC 响应 User{id: \"123\", name: \"...\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → HTTP 200 {\"id\": \"123\", \"name\": \"...\"}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Envoy gRPC-JSON 转码器配置&#10;http_filters:&#10;  - name: envoy.filters.http.grpc_json_transcoder&#10;    typed_config:&#10;      &#39;@type&#39;: type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.grpc_json_transcoder.v3.GrpcJsonTranscoder&#10;      proto_descriptor: &#39;/etc/envoy/api.pb&#39; # 编译后的 proto descriptor&#10;      services: [&#39;user.UserService&#39;]&#10;      print_options:&#10;        add_whitespace: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Envoy gRPC-JSON 转码器配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">http_filters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">envoy.filters.http.grpc_json_transcoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typed_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.grpc_json_transcoder.v3.GrpcJsonTranscoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      proto_descriptor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/etc/envoy/api.pb'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 编译后的 proto descriptor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user.UserService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      print_options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        add_whitespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>转码方案的优点是<strong>类型安全</strong>（翻译由 proto 定义驱动，不会遗漏字段），缺点是需要维护 proto 文件和 HTTP 注解的同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"header-变换\">Header 变换</h2><p>Header 变换是最常见的请求/响应修改操作：</p>\n<h3 id=\"注入上下文信息\">注入上下文信息</h3><p>网关验证 JWT 后，将解析出的用户信息注入到 Header，下游服务直接读取，无需重复解析 JWT：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kong request-transformer 插件&#10;add:&#10;  headers:&#10;    - &#39;X-User-ID: $(consumer.custom_id)&#39;&#10;    - &#39;X-User-Role: $(jwt.claims.role)&#39;&#10;    - &#39;X-Request-ID: $(uuid)&#39; # 注入请求追踪 ID&#10;remove:&#10;  headers:&#10;    - &#39;Authorization&#39; # 下游服务不需要 JWT，移除避免泄露\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kong request-transformer 插件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'X-User-ID: $(consumer.custom_id)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'X-User-Role: $(jwt.claims.role)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'X-Request-ID: $(uuid)'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 注入请求追踪 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Authorization'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 下游服务不需要 JWT，移除避免泄露</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"跨域-cors-处理\">跨域（CORS）处理</h3><p>将 CORS 控制集中在网关，后端服务无需处理跨域 Header：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 响应变换：添加 CORS Header&#10;add:&#10;  headers:&#10;    - &#39;Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://app.example.com&#39;&#10;    - &#39;Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE&#39;&#10;    - &#39;Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 响应变换：添加 CORS Header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://app.example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"请求体变换\">请求体变换</h2><h3 id=\"json-字段映射\">JSON 字段映射</h3><p>当客户端 API 定义与后端 API 定义不一致时，网关做字段映射而无需改动后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- Kong 自定义插件（Lua）：重写请求体字段名&#10;local body = kong.request.get_body()&#10;if body then&#10;  -- 客户端用 userId，后端期待 user_id&#10;  body.user_id = body.userId&#10;  body.userId = nil&#10;  kong.service.request.set_body(body)&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Kong 自定义插件（Lua）：重写请求体字段名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local body = kong.request.get_body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if body then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 客户端用 userId，后端期待 user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body.user_id = body.userId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body.userId = nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  kong.service.request.set_body(body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"xml-json-转换\">XML↔JSON 转换</h3><p>对接遗留 SOAP 服务时，网关将客户端的 JSON 请求转换为 SOAP/XML 格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端发送:&#10;POST /api/legacy/order {&quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;12345&quot;}&#10;&#10;网关转换为:&#10;POST /ws/OrderService&#10;&lt;soap:Envelope&gt;&#10;  &lt;soap:Body&gt;&#10;    &lt;getOrder&gt;&lt;orderId&gt;12345&lt;/orderId&gt;&lt;/getOrder&gt;&#10;  &lt;/soap:Body&gt;&#10;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端发送:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST /api/legacy/order {\"orderId\": \"12345\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>网关转换为:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST /ws/OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;soap:Envelope></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;soap:Body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;getOrder>&#x3C;orderId>12345&#x3C;/orderId>&#x3C;/getOrder></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/soap:Body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/soap:Envelope></span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类转换通常用 XSLT 模板定义映射规则，网关应用模板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应裁剪与聚合\">响应裁剪与聚合</h2><h3 id=\"字段过滤-response-filtering\">字段过滤（Response Filtering）</h3><p>当后端返回大量字段但客户端只需要其中几个（尤其是移动端带宽敏感）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 只保留指定字段，移除其余&#10;response_transformer:&#10;  remove:&#10;    json: [&#39;internalId&#39;, &#39;auditLog&#39;, &#39;debugInfo&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只保留指定字段，移除其余</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">response_transformer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'internalId'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auditLog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'debugInfo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或者使用 GraphQL 网关实现更精细的字段选择，客户端自主声明所需字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"响应聚合-response-aggregation\">响应聚合（Response Aggregation）</h3><p>网关并发调用多个后端，将响应合并后返回给客户端（减少客户端的多次请求）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant GW as API Gateway&#10;    participant US as 用户服务&#10;    participant OS as 订单服务&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/dashboard/summary&#10;    par 并发调用&#10;        GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /users/profile&#10;        GW-&gt;&gt;OS: GET /orders/recent&#10;    end&#10;    US--&gt;&gt;GW: {name, avatar}&#10;    OS--&gt;&gt;GW: {orders: [...]}&#10;    GW--&gt;&gt;C: {profile: {...}, orders: [...]}\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant GW as API Gateway\n    participant US as 用户服务\n    participant OS as 订单服务\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/dashboard/summary\n    par 并发调用\n        GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /users/profile\n        GW-&gt;&gt;OS: GET /orders/recent\n    end\n    US--&gt;&gt;GW: {name, avatar}\n    OS--&gt;&gt;GW: {orders: [...]}\n    GW--&gt;&gt;C: {profile: {...}, orders: [...]}</pre><p>响应聚合是 BFF 模式的核心能力，详见同 Hub 的 <code>_INTRODUCTION.md</code> 中对 BFF 的介绍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路径重写\">路径重写</h2><p>网关对外暴露的 URL 结构与后端实际路径可以不同。路径重写让网关做&quot;接口版本号剥离&quot;或&quot;路径规整&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"外部路径: /api/v1/users/123&#10;后端路径: /users/123        (v1 前缀由网关剥离)&#10;&#10;外部路径: /v2/orders/456&#10;后端路径: /orders/456?version=2  (版本号转为查询参数)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>外部路径: /api/v1/users/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后端路径: /users/123        (v1 前缀由网关剥离)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>外部路径: /v2/orders/456</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后端路径: /orders/456?version=2  (版本号转为查询参数)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kong route 配置：路径重写&#10;paths: [&#39;/api/v1/users&#39;]&#10;strip_path: true # 转发时移除 /api/v1/users 前缀&#10;service:&#10;  path: &#39;/&#39; # 后端路径\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kong route 配置：路径重写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">strip_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 转发时移除 /api/v1/users 前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 后端路径</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"变换链的顺序\">变换链的顺序</h2><p>多个变换插件叠加时，顺序很重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"请求进入网关&#10;  → 1. 认证（验证 JWT，提取用户信息）&#10;  → 2. 限流检查（基于用户 ID）&#10;  → 3. 请求 Header 注入（X-User-ID, X-Request-ID）&#10;  → 4. 请求体变换（字段映射）&#10;  → 5. 协议转换（REST → gRPC）&#10;  → 6. 转发给上游&#10;&#10;响应返回&#10;  → 7. 协议转换（gRPC → JSON）&#10;  → 8. 响应 Header 清理（移除内部 Header）&#10;  → 9. 响应裁剪（过滤敏感字段）&#10;  → 10. 返回给客户端\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>请求进入网关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 1. 认证（验证 JWT，提取用户信息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 2. 限流检查（基于用户 ID）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 3. 请求 Header 注入（X-User-ID, X-Request-ID）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 4. 请求体变换（字段映射）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 5. 协议转换（REST → gRPC）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 6. 转发给上游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>响应返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 7. 协议转换（gRPC → JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 8. 响应 Header 清理（移除内部 Header）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 9. 响应裁剪（过滤敏感字段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 10. 返回给客户端</span></span></code></pre></div><p>顺序错误会导致逻辑问题（如限流在 JWT 解析之前执行，则无法按用户 ID 限流）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>协议转换与请求变换让网关成为系统的&quot;适配器层&quot;：gRPC-HTTP 转码让内外部协议解耦；Header 变换集中处理用户上下文注入和 CORS；请求体变换处理字段映射和格式转换；响应聚合减少客户端的多次请求往返。关键是维护一个清晰的变换链顺序（认证→限流→Header 注入→协议转换），避免插件间的依赖问题。第 2 章<a href=\"../security/authentication-at-gateway\">网关层认证机制</a>深入讲解安全相关的变换细节。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接","id":"协议转换与请求变换-网关如何做格式桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么协议转换是必要的？","id":"为什么协议转换是必要的"},{"level":2,"text":"gRPC-HTTP 转码","id":"grpc-http-转码"},{"level":2,"text":"Header 变换","id":"header-变换"},{"level":3,"text":"注入上下文信息","id":"注入上下文信息"},{"level":3,"text":"跨域（CORS）处理","id":"跨域-cors-处理"},{"level":2,"text":"请求体变换","id":"请求体变换"},{"level":3,"text":"JSON 字段映射","id":"json-字段映射"},{"level":3,"text":"XML↔JSON 转换","id":"xml-json-转换"},{"level":2,"text":"响应裁剪与聚合","id":"响应裁剪与聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"字段过滤（Response Filtering）","id":"字段过滤-response-filtering"},{"level":3,"text":"响应聚合（Response Aggregation）","id":"响应聚合-response-aggregation"},{"level":2,"text":"路径重写","id":"路径重写"},{"level":2,"text":"变换链的顺序","id":"变换链的顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路由与负载均衡：网关如何将请求精准分发到后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/routing-load-balancing"},"next":{"title":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authentication-at-gateway"}}